= Defense and the Military

A professional military loyal to the Constitution is the last backstop of any republic.

- @civil_military_reform: Reinforce civil-military norms
- @veterans_programs: Expand veterans programs
- @cut_pentagon: Trim the defense budget
- @easy_discard

@civil_military_reform
on-arrival: military_loyalty += 0.06; institutions += 2; subversion_progress -= 0.5; progressive_dissent += 1; month_actions += 1

New codes of conduct and training reaffirm the oath to the Constitution.

@veterans_programs
subtitle: -1 budget
unavailable-subtitle: Need 1 budget.
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; military_loyalty += 0.03; rural_dem += 2*(1-dissent); working_dem += 1*(1-dissent); month_actions += 1

We win the gratitude of veterans.

@cut_pentagon
on-arrival: budget += 2; military_loyalty -= 0.04; progressive_dissent -= 3; moderate_dissent += 3; intl_relation -= 2; month_actions += 1

Savings are redirected, though generals grumble.
